1
00:00:03,507 --> 00:00:07,213
<i>I remember it
in the most unexpected moments.</i>

2
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:11,241
<i>My heart racing beyond control,</i>

3
00:00:11,241 --> 00:00:15,557
<i>and when everything seemed to shine.</i>

4
00:00:16,665 --> 00:00:19,708
[Meigakusha]

5
00:00:21,171 --> 00:00:22,685
- Ms. Yamane.
- Yes?

6
00:00:22,685 --> 00:00:23,924
Is this the document?

7
00:00:23,924 --> 00:00:28,491
<i>I think I'm living all right in the present.</i>

8
00:00:28,491 --> 00:00:33,655
<i>I have a gentle family,
and coworkers at a comfortable distance.</i>

9
00:00:33,655 --> 00:00:35,961
The interim report is done.

10
00:00:35,961 --> 00:00:38,767
Did the parent company say anything?
[Development Project Report]

11
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:41,046
They said there are no problems.

12
00:00:41,046 --> 00:00:43,640
Looks like we can start developing on time.

13
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:47,643
Then we need to speak
with the vendor about a contract.

14
00:00:47,643 --> 00:00:51,726
And we have to discuss
having an engineer stationed here.

15
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:55,289
Want me to help?

16
00:00:55,289 --> 00:00:58,415
No, I'll do my best. Thank you.

17
00:00:58,415 --> 00:00:59,821
I see.

18
00:01:00,979 --> 00:01:03,012
Everyone, good work!

19
00:01:03,012 --> 00:01:05,671
Good work!

20
00:01:05,671 --> 00:01:07,108
Here, ice cream.

21
00:01:07,108 --> 00:01:08,366
It's hot today.

22
00:01:08,366 --> 00:01:11,330
What? I was planning to fast, though.

23
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:14,051
It's fine. Ice cream is water.

24
00:01:14,051 --> 00:01:16,718
- Thank you. I'll have some.
- Thank you.

25
00:01:16,718 --> 00:01:18,078
Ms. Yamane, here.

26
00:01:18,078 --> 00:01:20,082
Thank you.

27
00:01:21,706 --> 00:01:23,235
Take one.

28
00:01:23,235 --> 00:01:24,736
<i>But...</i>

29
00:01:36,965 --> 00:01:39,724
[Yamane]

30
00:01:44,272 --> 00:01:45,625
I'm home.

31
00:01:45,625 --> 00:01:47,106
Welcome back.

32
00:01:48,673 --> 00:01:51,632
This came from Mom and Dad.

33
00:01:51,632 --> 00:01:53,719
Thanks.

34
00:01:55,808 --> 00:02:00,592
Oh, and apparently...
there's a class reunion.

35
00:02:03,690 --> 00:02:06,657
[Class Reunion Notice]

36
00:02:06,657 --> 00:02:10,654
[Tsurushiro High School,
Class of 2019 Graduates - Reunion Venue]

37
00:02:18,853 --> 00:02:22,024
[Sorry, I can't make it today.
Got stuck at work.]

38
00:02:39,518 --> 00:02:41,106
Excuse me...

39
00:02:43,579 --> 00:02:45,596
You're Yamane, right?

40
00:02:46,946 --> 00:02:49,213
Yes, that's me.

41
00:02:51,291 --> 00:02:53,086
Do you remember me?

42
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:56,504
It's me. Taguchi.

43
00:02:59,502 --> 00:03:01,656
Taguchi?

44
00:03:11,522 --> 00:03:13,469
Wait, what?

45
00:03:13,469 --> 00:03:16,722
Long time no see, Yamane.

46
00:04:02,701 --> 00:04:04,287
Can I sit?

47
00:04:04,287 --> 00:04:06,669
Oh, sure.

48
00:04:07,698 --> 00:04:11,300
I didn't have anyone to talk to,
so this really helps. Thanks.

49
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,773
No problem.

50
00:04:14,892 --> 00:04:16,491
Are you drinking?

51
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:18,675
I am.

52
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:20,181
Want another?

53
00:04:20,181 --> 00:04:22,908
No, I'm fine.

54
00:04:28,919 --> 00:04:32,282
You seem like a different person, somehow.

55
00:04:32,282 --> 00:04:33,829
Huh?

56
00:04:34,677 --> 00:04:37,904
I mean, back then, you...

57
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,254
were a bit prickly.

58
00:04:41,254 --> 00:04:42,996
Who are you?

59
00:04:45,898 --> 00:04:48,301
This is my spot.

60
00:04:52,505 --> 00:04:54,730
Prickly?

61
00:04:54,730 --> 00:05:00,436
Your look, the way you talked...
I don't mean it in a bad way.

62
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:05,988
Doesn't sound like a compliment either, huh?

63
00:05:08,377 --> 00:05:12,944
Well... You haven't changed, Yamane.

64
00:05:13,859 --> 00:05:15,047
You think so?

65
00:05:15,047 --> 00:05:16,316
Yeah.

66
00:05:16,316 --> 00:05:21,251
I mean, even with all these people here,
you're still in the corner.

67
00:05:22,414 --> 00:05:24,498
Sorry.

68
00:05:29,725 --> 00:05:31,351
A first-year?

69
00:05:32,053 --> 00:05:33,853
Huh?

70
00:05:33,853 --> 00:05:36,352
Our indoor shoes' colors match.

71
00:05:40,132 --> 00:05:42,953
Isn't it time for homeroom?

72
00:05:42,953 --> 00:05:45,840
For sports festival prep or something?

73
00:05:49,594 --> 00:05:55,068
Well, I was having trouble
getting along with everyone.

74
00:05:56,469 --> 00:05:59,669
And I couldn't stand it anymore,

75
00:06:00,343 --> 00:06:02,573
so I ended up here.

76
00:06:05,045 --> 00:06:08,685
Well, I'm being a bother, aren't I?

77
00:06:13,883 --> 00:06:16,403
Then you're the same as me.

78
00:06:26,386 --> 00:06:28,187
So...

79
00:06:29,305 --> 00:06:34,133
Does that mean I can stay here too?

80
00:06:37,836 --> 00:06:39,609
Do whatever you want.

81
00:07:02,721 --> 00:07:04,881
They're so cool.

82
00:07:07,764 --> 00:07:09,278
Huh?

83
00:07:10,613 --> 00:07:15,167
I mean, your piercings. I think they're cool.

84
00:07:17,715 --> 00:07:19,544
They don't scare you?

85
00:07:20,731 --> 00:07:22,275
Huh?

86
00:07:22,275 --> 00:07:23,909
I mean...

87
00:07:25,021 --> 00:07:27,287
I put them in because I like them,

88
00:07:27,287 --> 00:07:30,027
but I get told they're gross or scary.

89
00:07:31,350 --> 00:07:33,978
Oh, I see...

90
00:07:33,978 --> 00:07:35,384
Yeah.

91
00:07:38,191 --> 00:07:42,848
I think they suit you. They look nice.

92
00:07:46,505 --> 00:07:47,965
You do?

93
00:07:55,852 --> 00:07:58,232
I want ice cream.

94
00:07:58,232 --> 00:08:00,186
Is the store open?

95
00:08:00,777 --> 00:08:04,424
It's probably closed during class, isn't it?

96
00:08:08,346 --> 00:08:10,386
Wanna sneak out then?

97
00:08:16,246 --> 00:08:18,297
So...

98
00:08:18,957 --> 00:08:20,804
wanna sneak out again?

99
00:08:27,942 --> 00:08:30,064
Yeah.

100
00:08:30,064 --> 00:08:31,557
Let's go.

101
00:08:56,584 --> 00:08:58,725
- See you.
- Bye.

102
00:09:03,343 --> 00:09:04,896
Sorry, I'm late!

103
00:09:04,896 --> 00:09:06,824
What were you doing?

104
00:09:06,824 --> 00:09:09,984
They suddenly started talking about
relocations and stuff.

105
00:09:09,984 --> 00:09:11,379
Is everyone here?

106
00:09:11,379 --> 00:09:13,286
Yeah, look.

107
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:23,354
Looking for someone?

108
00:09:23,354 --> 00:09:25,803
No, not really.

109
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,981
Thanks.

110
00:09:31,091 --> 00:09:32,719
Here you go.

111
00:09:32,719 --> 00:09:34,836
Thank you.

112
00:09:40,144 --> 00:09:42,205
What's wrong?

113
00:09:42,205 --> 00:09:43,593
This is nice.

114
00:09:43,593 --> 00:09:46,358
Having a place like this
as your regular spot.

115
00:09:46,358 --> 00:09:51,590
No, I'm not good with loud places,

116
00:09:51,590 --> 00:09:54,727
so quiet spots like this calm me down.

117
00:09:56,139 --> 00:09:58,216
They calm you down?

118
00:09:58,216 --> 00:09:59,589
Yeah.

119
00:10:00,276 --> 00:10:02,764
I don't usually visit places like this.

120
00:10:02,764 --> 00:10:04,228
Oh, really?

121
00:10:04,228 --> 00:10:05,935
Yeah.

122
00:10:05,935 --> 00:10:08,368
- Here.
- Thank you.

123
00:10:09,607 --> 00:10:11,143
Well, then...

124
00:10:13,116 --> 00:10:14,403
Cheers.

125
00:10:14,403 --> 00:10:15,976
Cheers.

126
00:10:29,872 --> 00:10:31,432
Thanks.

127
00:10:40,908 --> 00:10:42,558
What's your name?

128
00:10:42,558 --> 00:10:43,945
Huh?

129
00:10:46,396 --> 00:10:48,379
I'm Taguchi.

130
00:10:50,192 --> 00:10:52,052
Ryosuke Taguchi.

131
00:10:54,363 --> 00:10:57,806
I'm Shiori Yamane.

132
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:03,113
Yamane, is the ice cream good?

133
00:11:03,961 --> 00:11:07,335
Yeah. It's good.

134
00:11:07,335 --> 00:11:08,783
Right?

135
00:11:11,171 --> 00:11:15,252
So... I'm in Class 4.

136
00:11:15,252 --> 00:11:17,118
What about you, Taguchi?

137
00:11:17,118 --> 00:11:18,601
Class 5.

138
00:11:19,846 --> 00:11:23,411
Then, are you in any clubs?

139
00:11:23,411 --> 00:11:26,946
No. Why do you want to know?

140
00:11:28,161 --> 00:11:35,818
I was just curious about
what kind of person you are,

141
00:11:35,818 --> 00:11:39,066
what you like, and so on.

142
00:11:39,066 --> 00:11:41,220
I see.

143
00:11:43,079 --> 00:11:45,729
Well, I'm exactly what I look like.

144
00:11:45,729 --> 00:11:47,957
I've got no friends.

145
00:11:47,957 --> 00:11:50,369
Plus, I like dressing like this,

146
00:11:50,369 --> 00:11:53,022
and no one can stop me.

147
00:11:55,311 --> 00:11:58,108
It's really important to you, huh?

148
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,273
Yeah, I guess.

149
00:12:15,855 --> 00:12:17,921
Hey!

150
00:12:17,921 --> 00:12:20,563
What are you two doing here?

151
00:12:33,056 --> 00:12:35,165
Yamane, are you drunk?

152
00:12:36,365 --> 00:12:38,911
- I'm not drunk.
- You definitely are.

153
00:12:38,911 --> 00:12:40,288
Let's go home.

154
00:12:40,288 --> 00:12:42,261
Check, please.

155
00:12:42,261 --> 00:12:44,063
Yes, sir.

156
00:12:52,973 --> 00:12:54,639
Your piercings.

157
00:12:56,474 --> 00:12:58,736
You don't wear them anymore?

158
00:13:00,148 --> 00:13:01,960
Why bring that up?

159
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:04,750
Would it get you in trouble at work?

160
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:07,459
No, that's not it.

161
00:13:07,459 --> 00:13:12,961
I stopped a long time ago,
and I dyed my hair black too, see?

162
00:13:17,667 --> 00:13:23,566
This way, I get along better
with the people around me.

163
00:13:25,195 --> 00:13:27,427
Besides, I'm an adult now.

164
00:13:29,609 --> 00:13:33,402
If you want to be seen positively,
you have to dress the part.

165
00:13:41,972 --> 00:13:46,340
Taguchi, you've changed.

166
00:13:50,428 --> 00:13:52,631
Your looks...

167
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:57,976
And everything inside feels so grown up.

168
00:13:59,449 --> 00:14:01,714
And you're so cool.

169
00:14:04,441 --> 00:14:09,964
But I'd like to see
the Taguchi with piercings again...

170
00:14:11,263 --> 00:14:13,761
in the future sometime.

171
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:30,461
Hey, so...

172
00:14:31,914 --> 00:14:33,524
So...

173
00:14:38,253 --> 00:14:39,953
Yamane?

174
00:14:42,224 --> 00:14:44,221
[Staff Room]
Who you are today

175
00:14:44,221 --> 00:14:46,731
creates who you are tomorrow.

176
00:14:46,731 --> 00:14:51,609
A person is made up of
that kind of continuity.

177
00:14:51,609 --> 00:14:57,714
So just doing whatever's fun right now
isn't proper.

178
00:14:57,714 --> 00:14:59,953
You understand?

179
00:14:59,953 --> 00:15:04,186
Yes. I'm sorry.

180
00:15:05,304 --> 00:15:09,613
Taguchi, I've told you before.

181
00:15:09,613 --> 00:15:12,115
What's with the hair and piercings?

182
00:15:12,115 --> 00:15:14,578
Our school's rules aren't that strict.

183
00:15:14,578 --> 00:15:17,174
But there's a limit.

184
00:15:18,199 --> 00:15:21,215
Hey, I'm taking your piercings.

185
00:15:24,024 --> 00:15:25,909
Your piercings.

186
00:15:32,112 --> 00:15:33,913
What a pain...

187
00:15:52,737 --> 00:15:54,657
Excuse us.

188
00:16:03,215 --> 00:16:05,401
What about your piercings?

189
00:16:07,129 --> 00:16:08,421
It's fine.

190
00:16:08,421 --> 00:16:10,583
I'm used to that kind of thing.

191
00:16:10,583 --> 00:16:13,303
Anyway, don't worry about it.

192
00:16:17,981 --> 00:16:20,074
I had fun.

193
00:16:24,303 --> 00:16:29,329
Ever since I started high school,

194
00:16:30,182 --> 00:16:33,354
I've never really fit in with my class.

195
00:16:35,088 --> 00:16:40,612
Being at school was always kind of painful.

196
00:16:42,765 --> 00:16:49,864
But today, for the first time,
I felt like I was having fun.

197
00:16:52,531 --> 00:16:54,242
And now...

198
00:16:56,702 --> 00:16:58,810
I told you it's fine.

199
00:16:58,810 --> 00:17:00,413
But...

200
00:17:03,260 --> 00:17:05,195
I have this.

201
00:17:05,195 --> 00:17:06,535
Huh?

202
00:17:09,542 --> 00:17:12,337
For when they get confiscated.

203
00:17:30,612 --> 00:17:32,632
Want a touch?

204
00:17:32,632 --> 00:17:37,489
A touch? I couldn't possibly do that.

205
00:17:37,489 --> 00:17:39,316
That's funny.

206
00:17:42,208 --> 00:17:44,321
Hey, Taguchi.

207
00:17:47,211 --> 00:17:51,874
Well, if you'd like, how about you and I...

208
00:18:03,053 --> 00:18:04,729
You awake?

209
00:18:07,128 --> 00:18:10,519
The taxi's almost here.
Get some more sleep.

210
00:18:10,519 --> 00:18:13,154
Yeah, thanks.

211
00:18:13,154 --> 00:18:14,734
No problem.

212
00:18:23,868 --> 00:18:25,428
Your ear.

213
00:18:30,211 --> 00:18:33,313
Oh, the holes are still there.

214
00:18:36,428 --> 00:18:38,031
Want a touch?

215
00:18:40,224 --> 00:18:41,930
Just kidding.

216
00:18:47,204 --> 00:18:49,774
They're still there.

217
00:18:54,693 --> 00:18:57,422
Taguchi, you might have changed...

218
00:19:00,315 --> 00:19:02,779
but you're still the same.

219
00:19:10,209 --> 00:19:12,138
To be honest,

220
00:19:13,914 --> 00:19:16,640
I still wear them sometimes.

221
00:19:21,238 --> 00:19:24,814
Today, I remembered my high school days

222
00:19:24,814 --> 00:19:27,387
and ended up bringing these.

223
00:19:29,211 --> 00:19:31,095
Well...

224
00:19:31,797 --> 00:19:35,639
the vibes didn't feel right
to wear them though.

225
00:19:53,746 --> 00:19:55,206
What?

226
00:19:55,899 --> 00:20:00,555
Sorry, they just bring back so many memories,

227
00:20:00,555 --> 00:20:03,296
and they suit you so well.

228
00:20:03,939 --> 00:20:06,399
It's kinda like...

229
00:20:08,649 --> 00:20:12,303
a "Welcome back, Taguchi" moment.

230
00:20:16,069 --> 00:20:21,445
I like this Taguchi the best.

231
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:30,687
You can't just say that. It's not fair.

232
00:20:32,059 --> 00:20:33,515
Huh?

233
00:20:46,708 --> 00:20:48,321
The taxi's here.

234
00:20:51,190 --> 00:20:53,333
Let's go, then.

235
00:20:53,333 --> 00:20:54,920
Okay.

236
00:21:00,922 --> 00:21:02,669
Take care.

237
00:21:08,612 --> 00:21:10,039
Wait.

238
00:21:14,276 --> 00:21:20,948
If you'd like,
how about you and I become friends again?

239
00:21:27,121 --> 00:21:28,916
Is that a no?

240
00:21:33,814 --> 00:21:36,455
I want us to be friends too.

241
00:21:43,273 --> 00:21:45,527
More than just friends.

242
00:21:50,876 --> 00:21:52,751
Well, good night.

243
00:21:52,751 --> 00:21:54,758
Please take her home.

244
00:22:04,489 --> 00:22:08,620
<i>I think I'm living all right in the present.</i>

245
00:22:08,620 --> 00:22:10,663
<i>I have a gentle family,</i>

246
00:22:10,663 --> 00:22:13,646
- <i>and coworkers at a comfortable distance.</i>
- Ms. Yamane,

247
00:22:13,646 --> 00:22:16,967
the engineer assigned here has arrived.
Is now a good time?

248
00:22:16,967 --> 00:22:19,274
Yes, it's fine.

249
00:22:21,336 --> 00:22:22,976
<i>But...</i>

250
00:22:24,413 --> 00:22:27,282
This is Taguchi, the engineer.

251
00:22:27,282 --> 00:22:32,332
Starting today, he'll be stationed here
every day as a project member.

252
00:22:32,332 --> 00:22:34,131
Every day...

253
00:22:34,131 --> 00:22:36,751
Handle the rest, okay?

254
00:22:36,751 --> 00:22:38,298
Okay.

255
00:22:47,269 --> 00:22:50,005
What a coincidence.

256
00:22:50,005 --> 00:22:52,658
Yeah, I'm shocked.

257
00:22:55,761 --> 00:22:57,970
Did you get home okay?

258
00:22:58,591 --> 00:23:00,086
Yeah.

259
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:05,488
I'll go get a laptop and access card.

260
00:23:06,161 --> 00:23:07,752
Sorry.

261
00:23:08,571 --> 00:23:10,413
This must be awkward.

262
00:23:12,134 --> 00:23:14,514
Not at all.

263
00:23:15,701 --> 00:23:17,688
Well...

264
00:23:21,658 --> 00:23:24,060
This works better for me.

265
00:23:26,243 --> 00:23:31,271
I look forward to working with you,
Ms. Yamane.

266
00:23:31,271 --> 00:23:35,036
<i>Those days when everything seemed to shine...</i>

267
00:23:35,676 --> 00:23:38,009
Likewise.

268
00:23:38,009 --> 00:23:42,503
<i>What if they come back even more vividly?</i>

269
00:23:45,365 --> 00:23:47,050
Wanna get lunch together?

270
00:23:47,050 --> 00:23:48,151
Sure.

271
00:23:48,151 --> 00:23:49,155
Want some?

272
00:23:49,155 --> 00:23:51,798
<i>Being together is fun,</i>

273
00:23:51,798 --> 00:23:54,209
<i>and it's hard to wait till we meet again.</i>

274
00:23:54,209 --> 00:23:57,018
I couldn't say it yesterday or today,
but tomorrow...

275
00:23:57,018 --> 00:23:59,992
<i>I just couldn't forget about Yamane.</i>
